/** @defgroup bflat_ts_integers bflat build - Integer code generation
 * @ingroup bflat_ts
 * @{
 *
 * @brief Tests of integer arithmetic as the compiler emits it.
 *
 *        32-bit values in 64-bit registers and their extensions, shifts and
 *        their counts, constants, the bit manipulation extensions,
 *        multiplication to a double width, addresses folded into loads, and
 *        64-bit arithmetic on a 32-bit target.
 *
 *        A program prints "ALL PASS" and returns zero, or prints every
 *        failed check and returns non-zero. Where the compiler has a switch
 *        for what a program tests, a second run builds the same program with
 *        the switch the other way.
 *
 * @}
 */
